  "title": "Generate a Ticket for the Parking Lot",
  "language": "python",
  "difficulty": "core",
  "estimatedMinutes": 45,
  "instructions": "Implement `TicketServiceImpl.generate_ticket` in `services/ticket_service_impl.py` (entry gates only, find-or-create the vehicle, assign a spot, store the ticket), the assignment rules in `SpotAssignmentStrategyImpl.assign_spot` (`strategies/spot_assignment_strategy_impl.py`) and `TicketController.generate_ticket` in `controllers/ticket_controller.py`. Only operational floors count; pick the floor with the fewest available spots of the vehicle's type (ties go to the lowest floor number), then its lowest-numbered spot, and mark it `OCCUPIED`. Every failure becomes `ResponseStatus.FAILURE` with `ticket=None`.",
